IAU Standards of Fundamental Astronomy (SOFA)

AstronomyKit includes the unchanged official SOFA 2023-10-11 C source archive and astrometry example under Scripts/reference-data/sources/sofa. Scripts/reference-data/sofa-fixed-star-reference.c is AstronomyKit-authored integration code that calls the official routines with FixedStar's no-proper-motion contract. The archived fixed-star fixture records output from that recipe. AstronomyKit and its fixture do not constitute software provided by or endorsed by SOFA.

